@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Camp Site";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<div class="columncontainer3-2">
    <img src="~/images/camp.png" width=90% height=90%/>
    <div>
        <div class="stickynote"><h4>Current food levels: 4</h4>
        <p>Parties can leave camp with <strong>4</strong> day's rations.</p></div>
        <div class="stickynote"><h4>Current security: 0</h4></div>
        <p>The surrounding <strong>0</strong> hexes away from the town are safer and can be traversed quickly with no risk. </p>
    </div>

</div>
<div>
    <h2>Residents</h2>
    <br />
    <h3>Nana Coralyn</h3>
    <p>Nana is the local shopkeep, distinguishable by finding the largest,
         most extravagant tent in the camp. She drives a hard bargain but 
         has been sponsoring tipoffs of nearby ruins.</p>
    <h3>Karst</h3>
    <p>Karst is the human sheriff who spearheaded the expedition into the
        forsaken continent. He often lingers near the supply area, helping with logistics and mapping.
    </p>
    <h3>Sister Mary</h3>
    <p>Sister Mary is a spry woman who has recently set up shop near the camp. 
        With her trusty golem butler Jeremiah, she has rapidly erected a herbal 
        remedy store, selling potions and cures. 
    </p>
    <h3>Galena Arnsdottir</h3>
    <p>Galena is an orc tinsmith, who shyly peddles her trade to those in need
        of a sturdy pot or pan. 
    </p>


</div>